// Figma's illustrations as data, not images, so page CSS can reach them (components/ui/Drawing.tsx
// paints each mark with a role). Exact paths from file "Petals", read 2026-11-05. Each drawing has one
// geometry, at its component's own size: Figma's smaller instances are this data scaled, so a viewBox
// does the same job. Nodes: hero flower 66:2207, leaders 66:2215, reading flower 66:2234, thumbs
// 56:1934 56:1939 56:1945, glyphs 54:1886 54:1892 54:1897 54:1902 54:1906 54:1912, cell 66:2345.

